{"type":"text","timestamp":1789367577150,"sessionID":"ses_f6176138cffeODZD3dhSK78dPo","part":{"id":"prt_09e9e5c98001UR3yJ0kSqqJPIl","messageID":"msg_09e9ddb7b001KA3QK1TMTgvfmv","sessionID":"ses_f6176138cffeODZD3dhSK78dPo","type":"text","text":"`seedPaths` = only the packet's **uncommitted** paths — so the 101M `.opencode/node_modules` is neither tracked, nor provisioned, nor seeded. Last mechanics probe: is it a symlink, and who made it (executor bootstrap is the suspect — meaning the 22s hides an ungoverned dependency leg).","time":{"start":1789367573656,"end":1789367577149}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1789367577243,"sessionID":"ses_f6176138cffeODZD3dhSK78dPo","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"bash","callID":"chatcmpl-tool-b2b7fbb1770ca28c","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"ls -la .opencode | grep -E \"node_modules|^l\" ; readlink .opencode/node_modules 2>/dev/null; echo \"---\"; ls -la .opencode/node_modules | head -4; echo \"--- executor-side provisioning? ----\"; grep -rn \"node_modules\" .opencode/package.json | head -3; grep -n \"frozen-lockfile\\|bun install\\|npm ci\" .opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/lib/deep-loop/*.ts .opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/fanout-run.cjs 2>/dev/null | head -5; echo \"--- tracked? ---\"; git check-ignore -v .opencode/node_modules 2>/dev/null || echo \"NOT-IGNORED\"; date -u +%FT%T.000Z"},"output":"lrwxr-xr-x@  1 michelkerkmeester  staff     70 Sep 14 08:10 manual-testing-playbook -> skills/cli-external-orchestration/cli-opencode/manual-testing-playbook\ndrwxr-xr-x@ 71 michelkerkmeester  staff   2272 Sep 14 08:10 node_modules\nlrwxr-xr-x@  1 michelkerkmeester  staff      8 Sep 14 08:10 specs -> ../specs\n---\ntotal 80\ndrwxr-xr-x@ 71 michelkerkmeester  staff   2272 Sep 14 08:10 .\ndrwxr-xr-x@ 20 michelkerkmeester  staff    640 Sep 14 08:10 ..\ndrwxr-xr-x@ 14 michelkerkmeester  staff    448 Sep 14 08:10 .bin\n--- executor-side provisioning? ----\n--- tracked? ---\n.opencode/.gitignore:1:node_modules\t.opencode/node_modules\n2026-09-14T06:32:57.000Z\n","metadata":{"output":"lrwxr-xr-x@  1 michelkerkmeester  staff     70 Sep 14 08:10 manual-testing-playbook -> skills/cli-external-orchestration/cli-opencode/manual-testing-playbook\ndrwxr-xr-x@ 71 michelkerkmeester  staff   2272 Sep 14 08:10 node_modules\nlrwxr-xr-x@  1 michelkerkmeester  staff      8 Sep 14 08:10 specs -> ../specs\n---\ntotal 80\ndrwxr-xr-x@ 71 michelkerkmeester  staff   2272 Sep 14 08:10 .\ndrwxr-xr-x@ 20 michelkerkmeester  staff    640 Sep 14 08:10 ..\ndrwxr-xr-x@ 14 michelkerkmeester  staff    448 Sep 14 08:10 .bin\n--- executor-side provisioning? ----\n--- tracked? ---\n.opencode/.gitignore:1:node_modules\t.opencode/node_modules\n2026-09-14T06:32:57.000Z\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"ls -la .opencode | grep -E \"node_modules|^l\" ; readlink .opencode/node_modules 2>/dev/null; echo \"---\"; ls -la .opencode/node_modules | head -4; echo \"--- executor-side provisioning? ----\"; grep -rn \"node_modules\" .opencode/package.json | head -3; grep -n \"frozen-lockfile\\|bun install\\|npm ci\" .opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/lib/deep-loop/*.ts .opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/fanout-run.cjs 2>/dev/null | head -5; echo \"--- tracked? ---\"; git check-ignore -v .opencode/node_modules 2>/dev/null || echo \"NOT-IGNORED\"; date -u +%FT%T.000Z","time":{"start":1789367577240,"end":1789367577242}},"id":"prt_09e9e6121001gGG1dhrjkD21sh","sessionID":"ses_f6176138cffeODZD3dhSK78dPo","messageID":"msg_09e9ddb7b001KA3QK1TMTgvfmv"}}
