{"type":"text","timestamp":1789367877800,"sessionID":"ses_f6176138cffeODZD3dhSK78dPo","part":{"id":"prt_09ea2d707001kWpc6e7yXWU12O","messageID":"msg_09ea21965001x7QV5Tx2JcDJxO","sessionID":"ses_f6176138cffeODZD3dhSK78dPo","type":"text","text":"Validator decoded: **last-matching record wins**, ledger-backing = frames-exist (mine: backed), receipt cross-check opt-in. The sanctioned remedy (validator lines 15-18, 254-257): direct-append the canonical record after the gateway event — no second gateway call, no duplication of the *lossy* projection. Also decoding the ledger frame to pin WHERE the fidelity dies (upcaster vs projector) — that's the L1 finding upgraded.","time":{"start":1789367867143,"end":1789367877799}}}
