{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1789368466833,"sessionID":"ses_f6176138cffeODZD3dhSK78dPo","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"write","callID":"chatcmpl-tool-a4bd0a95a2a03f51","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"{\"openQuestions\":[],\"resolvedQuestions\":[],\"keyFindings\":[{\"id\":\"f-101\",\"iteration\":1,\"severity\":\"P1\",\"label\":\"baseline drift: 82572 tracked / 1.7G / .opencode 353M today vs 82376/1.6GB/216M in the prior synthesis; pack stable at 2.06 GiB\"},{\"id\":\"f-102\",\"iteration\":1,\"severity\":\"P1\",\"label\":\"22.2 s underived and uninstrumented: (149.7-16.5)/6=22.2, and worktree-lifecycle.ts has zero timing calls; no leg weight exists anywhere\"},{\"id\":\"f-103\",\"iteration\":1,\"severity\":\"P1\",\"label\":\"setup legs L1-L7: full checkout, 7 ABSOLUTE->MAIN provision links, ungoverned 101M/5454-entry .opencode/node_modules bootstrap, >=1.54s cold + 0.10s warm status tax, per-file copyFileSync add-only seed, lease+heartbeats, unmeasured teardown\"},{\"id\":\"f-104\",\"iteration\":1,\"severity\":\"P2\",\"label\":\"redirection ruling's mechanism: the runner strips 12 GIT_* env redirectors before every git call (worktree-lifecycle.ts:161-183)\"},{\"id\":\"f-105\",\"iteration\":1,\"severity\":\"P1\",\"label\":\"contradiction between syntheses: provisioning links are ABSOLUTE->MAIN but the newer alternatives synthesis justifies relocation-safety by 'those links are relative'; conclusion right, justification wrong\"},{\"id\":\"f-106\",\"iteration\":1,\"severity\":\"P3\",\"label\":\"tracked relative self-links .opencode/specs -> ../specs and .opencode/manual-testing-playbook -> skills/... verified live\"},{\"id\":\"f-107\",\"iteration\":1,\"severity\":\"P3\",\"label\":\"shared-store maintenance residue: count-objects garbage; 29 worktrees in the fleet today\"},{\"id\":\"f-108\",\"iteration\":1,\"severity\":\"P2\",\"label\":\"extensions.worktreeConfig + core.sparseCheckout UNSET today; flip hazard applies to 29 worktrees\"},{\"id\":\"f-201\",\"iteration\":2,\"severity\":\"P1\",\"label\":\"their 62%/85% are tracked-only: the closure cone is 2,328 tracked files/~21.5M vs their 17,648/~252M wholesale-.opencode cone — 98.5% checkout cut, 93%+ of the true per-lane cost; wholesale-.opencode drags 15,320 unread tracked files (sk-design 148M unread by this lane)\"},{\"id\":\"f-202\",\"iteration\":2,\"severity\":\"P1\",\"label\":\"skip-worktree promotion: bits live in the lane-private index — NO shared state of any kind; detector-compatible because containment compares porcelain deltas and skipped entries are porcelain-silent; read-tree + ~80,244 skip-bits + checkout-index closure makes the index correct by construction, dissolving SWE-2's 'one real engineering detail'\"},{\"id\":\"f-203\",\"iteration\":2,\"severity\":\"P1\",\"label\":\"the 8th provision: .opencode/node_modules = REAL 101M/5,454, gitignored, untracked, absent from DEFAULT_SHARED_PATHS (7) and from the seed, no installer in the runner (executor/bootstrap-side, provenance unresolved); carries NO @spec-kit — wholesale-linkable under the resolution-containment invariant; precondition = the 14-site entry-point guard audit\"},{\"id\":\"f-204\",\"iteration\":2,\"severity\":\"P2\",\"label\":\"protocol gap: their prescribed instrument (throwaway clone) cannot measure the 29-worktree production interference they flagged; the packet's own verification precedent (manual run on the real main checkout with other sessions live) already licenses the production probe\"},{\"id\":\"f-205\",\"iteration\":2,\"severity\":\"P1\",\"label\":\"clonefile's hidden costs: 82,573+ inodes/lane; foreign-stat first status (copied MAIN index + fresh ctimes -> content-hash; BEST-case cold = 1.54s, theirs asserted); the ignored-tree question; ADR-002-restore compatibility verified\"},{\"id\":\"f-206\",\"iteration\":2,\"severity\":\"P2\",\"label\":\"detector cost shape from code: ONE porcelain + per-dirty-path hash + unattributable-exempt + opt-in baseline capture — no per-tracked-file premium; the 1.54s COLD status is already inside the 22.2s (the seed's uncommitted-path discovery pays it)\"}],\"ruledOutDirections\":[{\"direction\":\"re-deriving the 22.2 s leg weights from existing runner telemetry\",\"reason\":\"zero timing instrumentation in the 847-line lifecycle; totals only\",\"iteration\":1,\"evidence\":\"worktree-lifecycle.ts:1-847; implementation-summary.md:98-110\"},{\"direction\":\"attributing .opencode/node_modules to tracked checkout, provisioning, or seed\",\"reason\":\"tracked=0; absent from DEFAULT_SHARED_PATHS; seed list is packet-uncommitted only\",\"iteration\":1,\"evidence\":\"git ls-files=0; .opencode/.gitignore:1; worktree-lifecycle.ts:147-158; fanout-run.cjs:2834-2840\"},{\"direction\":\"timing read-tree + the ~80,244 skip-bit writes in this worktree\",\"reason\":\"writes MAIN's $GIT_DIR/worktrees/... — outside this lineage's write surface; the packet's stub-executor protocol owns it\",\"iteration\":2,\"evidence\":\"fanout-run.cjs:2818-2848; alternatives/synthesis.md:64\"},{\"direction\":\"counting a '79k deleted entries' status penalty for the skip-worktree variant\",\"reason\":\"skipped entries never appear in porcelain; the containment compares porcelain deltas\",\"iteration\":2,\"evidence\":\"deepseek/research.md:73; write-containment.ts:689-774\"}],\"metrics\":{\"iterationsCompleted\":2,\"openQuestions\":2,\"resolvedQuestions\":2,\"keyFindings\":14,\"convergenceScore\":0,\"coverageBySources\":{\"worktree-lifecycle.ts\":5,\"fanout-run.cjs\":2,\"implementation-summary.md\":1,\"alternatives/synthesis.md\":2,\"worktree-symlinks/synthesis.md\":2,\"write-containment.ts\":1,\"swe2-lane\":3,\"deepseek-lane\":2,\"measured-commands\":9},\"sourceFindings\":14,\"reconstructionGaps\":0}}\n","filePath":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/fanout-1789366204116-kfp53e-attempt-1-glm/specs/system-deep-loop/045-fanout-write-containment-hardening/research/lineages/glm/findings-registry.json"},"output":"Wrote file successfully."