{"type":"text","timestamp":1789368758658,"sessionID":"ses_f6176138cffeODZD3dhSK78dPo","part":{"id":"prt_09eb05ae5001nt1QgkKXPbJJD7","messageID":"msg_09eaff0af001AEQHzpjYEVECJW","sessionID":"ses_f6176138cffeODZD3dhSK78dPo","type":"text","text":"The picture: my three direct-appends wrote pretty-printed blobs; the gateway's projection refresh (at it2/it3) then rebuilt the lossy rows — leaving 4 good lines + a 55-line pretty blob. Rebuilding the 7-line state log: the 4 gateway-authored lines + my 3 canonical records, COMPACT, in the right order. Then re-verify all three iterations.","time":{"start":1789368752869,"end":1789368758657}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1789368759133,"sessionID":"ses_f6176138cffeODZD3dhSK78dPo","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"bash","callID":"chatcmpl-tool-a8ff3b19cf5298e2","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"GLM=\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/fanout-1789366204116-kfp53e-attempt-1-glm/specs/system-deep-loop/045-fanout-write-containment-hardening/research/lineages/glm\" GLM2=x; GLM=\"$GLM\" node -e \"\nconst fs=require('fs');\nconst dir=process.env.GLM;\nconst lines=fs.readFileSync(dir+'/deep-research-state.jsonl','utf8').split('\\n').filter(l=>l.trim());\nconst keep=lines.slice(0,4); // config + 3 lossy projections (gateway-authored)\nfor (const n of ['001','002','003']) {\n  keep.push(JSON.stringify(JSON.parse(fs.readFileSync(dir+'/events/iteration-'+n+'.json','utf8'))));\n}\nfs.writeFileSync(dir+'/deep-research-state.jsonl', keep.join('\\n')+'\\n','utf8');\nconsole.log('state log rebuilt:',keep.length,'single-line records');\n\" && for I in 1 2 3; do node .opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/verify-iteration.cjs --loop-type research --artifact-dir \"$GLM\" --iteration $I; echo \"VERIFY_EXIT($I)=$?\"; done; echo \"=== final state log ===\"; nl -ba \"$GLM/deep-research-state.jsonl\" | cut -c1-110; date -u +%FT%T.000Z"},"output":"state log rebuilt: 7 single-line records\nOK iteration 1 complete: narrative + route-proof + delta\nVERIFY_EXIT(1)=0\nOK iteration 2 complete: narrative + route-proof + delta\nVERIFY_EXIT(2)=0\nOK iteration 3 complete: narrative + route-proof + delta\nVERIFY_EXIT(3)=0\n=== final state log ===\n     1\t{\"type\":\"config\",\"topic\":\"fanout-glm-1789366204116-kfp53e\",\"maxIterations\":3,\"generation\":1,\"timestamp\"\n     2\t{\"type\":\"iteration\",\"iteration\":1,\"run\":1,\"status\":\"complete\",\"newInfoRatio\":1,\"ruledOut\":[\"legacy-json\n     3\t{\"type\":\"iteration\",\"iteration\":2,\"run\":2,\"status\":\"complete\",\"newInfoRatio\":0.85,\"ruledOut\":[\"legacy-j\n     4\t{\"type\":\"iteration\",\"