{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1789368865772,"sessionID":"ses_f6176138cffeODZD3dhSK78dPo","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"write","callID":"chatcmpl-tool-bdfd1c3cd3229c09","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"{\"openQuestions\":[\"q1 leg weights L1..L7 (no instrumentation; stub-protocol or instrumentation required)\",\"teardown cost: release+forced remove+prune over ~1.7G/82,572+5,454+lineage unlinks — never mentioned, never measured\",\"the 101M/5,454-entry dependency bootstrap: producing process (executor plugin loader vs launch wrapper) and its seconds\",\"the skip-primary's one-time cost: read-tree + ~80,244 skip-bit writes\",\"the clonefile's foreign-stat first-status hash; its 1-4 s claim; WHICH ignored-tree flavor (working-tree clone vs checkout clone)\",\"the 29-worktree production interference of the sparse flip (their own hazard; the throwaway-clone instrument cannot reproduce it)\",\"mid-run relocation behavior: prompt-pack paths, executor cwd, and the runner's cached worktreeDir go stale simultaneously; never exercised\",\"the version-gate's 'older git refuses' floor — unpinned (git 2.50.1 (Apple Git-155) verified; the compat floor never stated)\",\"the 8th provision's precondition: the 14-site entry-point-guard audit (the symlink wave's own open fork)\",\"who materializes .opencode/node_modules at worktree birth (executor bootstrap vs launch wrapper) — provenance unresolved\"],\"resolvedQuestions\":[\"q1 (structural): the 22.2 s = checkout + 7 links + 101M ungoverned bootstrap + >=1.54s cold/0.10s warm statuses + add-only seed + lease + unmeasured teardown; weights carried\",\"q2: the closure cone (2,328 tracked files, ~29M) vs their 17,648/~252M wholesale-.opencode cone: 98.5% checkout cut, 92% all-in\",\"q3: YES — skip-worktree in the lane-private index: zero shared state, detector-compatible by porcelain-delta construction, dissolves the clonefile's index problem\",\"q4: the clonefile variant survives (ADR-002-restore verified) but its pricing missed inodes, foreign-stat first-status, and the ignored-tree question; its hardest detail is solved by the sidelined mechanism\",\"q5: relocation = path-free below the runner, name+base-keyed at the runner, frozen-absolute at dispatch: safe between attempts, untested mid-run; the adoption order is #0 8th-provision, #1 skip-primary closure, #2 clonefile-on-top\"],\"keyFindings\":[{\"id\":\"f-101\",\"iteration\":1,\"severity\":\"P1\",\"label\":\"baseline drift: 82572 tracked / 1.7G / .opencode 353M today vs 82376/1.6GB/216M in the prior synthesis; pack stable at 2.06 GiB\"},{\"id\":\"f-102\",\"iteration\":1,\"severity\":\"P1\",\"label\":\"22.2 s underived and uninstrumented: (149.7-16.5)/6=22.2, and worktree-lifecycle.ts has zero timing calls; no leg weight exists anywhere\"},{\"id\":\"f-103\",\"iteration\":1,\"severity\":\"P1\",\"label\":\"setup legs L1-L7: full checkout, 7 ABSOLUTE->MAIN provision links, ungoverned 101M/5454-entry .opencode/node_modules bootstrap, >=1.54s cold + 0.10s warm status tax, per-file copyFileSync add-only seed, lease+heartbeats, unmeasured teardown\"},{\"id\":\"f-104\",\"iteration\":1,\"severity\":\"P2\",\"label\":\"redirection ruling's mechanism: the runner strips 12 GIT_* env redirectors before every git call (worktree-lifecycle.ts:161-183)\"},{\"id\":\"f-105\",\"iteration\":1,\"severity\":\"P1\",\"label\":\"contradiction between syntheses: provisioning links are ABSOLUTE->MAIN but the newer alternatives synthesis justifies relocation-safety by 'those links are relative'; conclusion right, justification wrong\"},{\"id\":\"f-106\",\"iteration\":1,\"severity\":\"P3\",\"label\":\"tracked relative self-links .opencode/specs -> ../specs and .opencode/manual-testing-playbook -> skills/... verified live\"},{\"id\":\"f-107\",\"iteration\":1,\"severity\":\"P3\",\"label\":\"shared-store maintenance residue: count-objects garbage; 29 worktrees in the fleet today\"},{\"id\":\"f-108\",\"iteration\":1,\"severity\":\"P2\",\"label\":\"extensions.worktreeConfig + core.sparseCheckout UNSET today; flip hazard applies to 29 worktrees\"},{\"id\":\"f-201\",\"iteration\":2,\"severity\":\"P1\",\"label\":\"their 62%/85% are tracked-only: the closure cone is 2,328 tracked files vs their 17,628+182 wholesale-.opencode+packet cone — 98.5% checkout cut; byte-corrected by f-303 (their wholesale cone ~252M tracked vs closure ~29M = 8.7x, not 11.4x)\",\"note\":\"it2's 21.5M/11.4x/93%+ superseded by f-303's reconciliation\"},{\"id\":\"f-202\",\"iteration\":2,\"severity\":\"P1\",\"label\":\"skip-worktree promotion: bits live in the lane-private index — NO shared state of any kind; detector-compatible because containment compares porcelain deltas and skipped entries are porcelain-silent; read-tree + ~80,244 skip-bits + checkout-index closure makes the index correct by construction\"},{\"id\":\"f-203\",\"iteration\":2,\"severity\":\"P1\",\"label\":\"the 8th provision: .opencode/node_modules = REAL 101M/5,454, gitignored, untracked, absent from DEFAULT_SHARED_PATHS (7) and from the seed, no installer in the runner; NO @spec-kit — wholesale-linkable; precondition = the 14-site entry-point-guard audit\"},{\"id\":\"f-204\",\"iteration\":2,\"severity\":\"P2\",\"label\":\"protocol gap: the throwaway-clone instrument cannot measure the 29-worktree production interference; the packet's own verification precedent (production run with other sessions live) already licenses the production probe\"},{\"id\":\"f-205\",\"iteration\":2,\"severity\":\"P1\",\"label\":\"clonefile's hidden costs: 82,573+ inodes/lane; foreign-stat first status; the ignored-tree question; ADR-002-restore compatibility verified\"},{\"id\":\"f-206\",\"iteration\":2,\"severity\":\"P2\",\"label\":\"detector cost shape from code: ONE porcelain + per-dirty-path hash + unattributable-exempt + opt-in baseline capture — no per-tracked-file premium; the 1.54s COLD status is already inside the 22.2s\"},{\"id\":\"f-301\",\"iteration\":3,\"severity\":\"P1\",\"label\":\"relocation: path-free at the fencing/watermark/lease/link layers (measured); the runner's discovery/keep/reclaim = base+prefix+name (fanout-run.cjs:514-515,3155-3157,2882) — a moved tree is invisible; relocation survives BETWEEN attempts, is untested mid-run (prompt paths + cwd + cached worktreeDir all go stale)\"},{\"id\":\"f-302\",\"iteration\":3,\"severity\":\"P2\",\"label\":\"attribution unknown x3: publish manifests carry no provenance (source_dir+entries only), receipts absent 3/3, while executor blocks exist in config+invocation-metadata+state records — consistent with a receipts/manifest-only read (inference); fix: the runner copies the provenance it already holds into the manifest\"},{\"id\":\"f-303\",\"iteration\":3,\"severity\":\"P1\",\"label\":\"reconciliation: closure = ~29M tracked (sdl 20M + infra ~7M + packet 1.9M) not 21.5M; ratios 7.6x files / ~8.7x tracked bytes, not 11.4x; all-in discount 92%, not 93%+; their 62% family figure survives the drift (609M/1,560M = 61% today), their 85% packet-granularity does not survive the closure\"},{\"id\":\"f-304\",\"iteration\":3,\"severity\":\"P1\",\"label\":\"the consolidated unmeasured ledger: nine items (leg weights, teardown, dependency-bootstrap provenance+seconds, skip-primary one-time cost, clonefile foreign-stat/claim/flavor, 29-tree interference, mid-run relocation, the unpinned version floor, the guard audit)\"},{\"id\":\"f-305\",\"iteration\":3,\"severity\":\"P1\",\"label\":\"reordered adoption: #0 the 8th provision (one symlink: -101M/-5,454/-install-seconds); #1 the skip-primary closure cone (zero shared state, detector-compatible by construction; porcelain sparse = its DX variant, priced with the 2 keys + 1 file + the 29-tree gate); #2 clonefile-on-top (rescued); their default-off-until-measured constraint retained, measured on the production repo per the packet's own precedent\"}],\"ruledOutDirections\":[{\"direction\":\"re-deriving the 22.2 s leg weights from existing runner telemetry\",\"reason\":\"zero timing instrumentation in the 847-line lifecycle; totals only\",\"iteration\":1,\"evidence\":\"worktree-lifecycle.ts:1-847; implementation-summary.md:98-110\"},{\"direction\":\"attributing .opencode/node_modules to tracked checkout, provisioning, or seed\",\"reason\":\"tracked=0; absent from DEFAULT_SHARED_PATHS; seed list is packet-uncommitted only\",\"iteration\":1,\"evidence\":\"git ls-files=0; .opencode/.gitignore:1; worktree-lifecycle.ts:147-158; fanout-run.cjs:2834-2840\"},{\"direction\":\"timing read-tree + the ~80,244 skip-bit writes in this worktree\",\"reason\":\"writes MAIN's $GIT_DIR/worktrees/... — outside this lineage's write surface; the packet's stub-executor protocol owns it\",\"iteration\":2,\"evidence\":\"fanout-run.cjs:2818-2848; alternatives/synthesis.md:64\"},{\"direction\":\"counting a '79k deleted entries' status penalty for the skip-worktree variant\",\"reason\":\"skipped entries never appear in porcelain; the containment compares porcelain deltas\",\"iteration\":2,\"evidence\":\"deepseek/research.md:73; write-containment.ts:689-774\"},{\"direction\":\"locating the attribution writer in the runner within this iteration's read budget\",\"reason\":\"the surface was not found; mechanism recorded as inference, effect (unknown x3) as observation\",\"iteration\":3,\"evidence\":\"research/fanout-attribution.md; luna/publish-manifest.json; fanout-run.cjs:3476-3569\"}],\"metrics\":{\"iterationsCompleted\":3,\"openQuestions\":10,\"resolvedQuestions\":5,\"keyFindings\":19,\"convergenceScore\":0,\"coverageBySources\":{\"worktree-lifecycle.ts\":5,\"fanout-run.cjs\":5,\"implementation-summary.md\":1,\"alternatives/synthesis.md\":2,\"worktree-symlinks/synthesis.md\":2,\"write-containment.ts\":2,\"verify-iteration.cjs\":1,\"prior-lanes(deepseek/luna/swe2)\":7,\"measured-commands\":12,\"runner-state-files(lease/pointer/fencing/watermark/manifest)\":6},\"sourceFindings\":19,\"reconstructionGaps\":0}}\n","filePath":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/f