ion pins, the consolidated unmeasured ledger, the reordered adoption | 0.75 | complete | 5 | OK (route-proof + delta, ledger-backed) |\n \n+## Open Questions (carried to synthesis)\n+\n+q1 leg weights; the 101M dependency-bootstrap provenance; the skip-primary's one-time cost; the clonefile's foreign-stat/ignored-tree; the 29-worktree production interference; mid-run relocation; the unpinned version floor; the 14-site guard audit. (Registry `openQuestions`, 10 items.)\n+\n ## Next Focus\n \n-Iteration 3 — what they missed in relocation (which surfaces actually pin paths), the consolidated unmeasured ledger (teardown, dependency-leg provenance, foreign-stat, bit-writes, interference), and the reordered adoption path.\n+None — the cap is reached; synthesis follows.\n","additions":13,"deletions":9},"truncated":false},"title":"specs/system-deep-loop/045-fanout-write-containment-hardening/research/lineages/glm/deep-research-dashboard.md","time":{"start":1789368877803,"end":1789368877805}},"id":"prt_09eb21413001V7PcQoqP6H7bbl","sessionID":"ses_f6176138cffeODZD3dhSK78dPo","messageID":"msg_09eb07c6e001h3MHDj0XgUrVix"}}
